  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "台文通訊BONG報320期-編輯室ê話"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">11--月ê雜誌有真濟kap環境相關ê文章，棲地復育講座〈外來種ê入侵kap原生植物ê保育〉hōo lán認bat「外來植物」是啥mi̍h？伊koh對lán ê環境保育造成啥mih影響？台語sa攏有講座〈環境信託——民間守護台灣最後ê力量〉hōo lán看著台灣kap外國tī tsit个議題拍拚ê過程，kap接suà--落-去發展ê可能性。除了專題探討以外，mā有bē少描寫郊外自然光景ê作品。〈Peh玉山前峰〉kā寶貴、享受ê peh山經驗記錄kah真幼膩。遊記〈淡水一日遊〉kā規工ê行程沓沓仔講hōo你聽，bē輸讀者mā kap伊做伙去tshit-thô一遍。「我若來港都——讀〈你若來港都〉」短短ê詩，kā港都ê好kap suí lóng報hōo你知。逐家緊趁iáu無hiah寒ê 11月，sì-kè去行行--leh，用目睭kap筆記錄koh-khah濟精彩ê光景！</span></p><p><br /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg-Qx_3aNXlv6eyFuD_kaceUBx9rjNsw_kEgxUZiD_Jl-q3zxygNrPGKpXrKt7BVXVBzxOZSkjat3e7KhcfKuU4_3r2FVaHtTkI_kmC7asoNLzgw_foy_K0Pp8WynnKCDxLq3SPWpVgphzt/s1424/320%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg-Qx_3aNXlv6eyFuD_kaceUBx9rjNsw_kEgxUZiD_Jl-q3zxygNrPGKpXrKt7BVXVBzxOZSkjat3e7KhcfKuU4_3r2FVaHtTkI_kmC7asoNLzgw_foy_K0Pp8WynnKCDxLq3SPWpVgphzt/w450-h640/320%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><div><div><span face=\"&quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif\" style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報320期，2020年11月出刊。</b></span></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><sp